{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024115907811-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024141852\"/><p>鰂魚涌有人猝死。今晨(24日)11時29分，執法部門接獲鰂魚涌英皇道989-991a號新威園一單位的業主報案，指姓唐(27歲)內地女住戶，在房間內懷疑暈倒。救援人員接報到場，經檢驗後，事主當場證實死亡。案件列作「屍體發現」，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:02:05.015031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:59:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:34.672127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:34.672127+00:00","content_hash":"717296dffa4d3c1a617cefdcb3d13b3506dce516d7b775e1e299c94b437ed21d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}